build clean, custom user interfaces.\n\n**• Real-Time Customization**  \nModify position, size, colors, fonts, corners, and strokes instantly. The properties panel adjusts to whatever you select.\n\n**• Button-to-Frame Binding System**  \nEasily connect any button to toggle frames or elements—no scripting required.\n\n**• Smooth Slide-In Panels**  \nHide and show the Toolbox and Properties panels using smart sliding arrows, keeping your workspace clean and focused.\n\n**• Drag and Drop Editing**  \nMove any UI element freely with your mouse, directly inside the editor. Visual editing made simple.\n\n**• Auto-Remove In-Game Tools**  \nKULTHX removes all tools from your character and backpack automatically, ensuring nothing interrupts your editing flow.\n\n**• Immersive Editing Environment**  \nThe camera moves above the sky, a chill soundtrack starts playing, and the game switches to night mode—all locally—setting the mood for focused design.\n\n**• Beautiful Welcome Screen & Logo**  \nStart your session with a sleek welcome screen and custom-designed KULTHX logo that elevates your experience.\n\n---\n\n> Whether you're a beginner or advanced UI builder, KULTHX Editor gives you the freedom to build, design, and express with ease.","tags":["RobloxGUI RobloxEditor KULTHXEditor RobloxGUIT"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"65779e9944d7f0b0955164aa","username":"kulthor","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f126a30387527ced3876b226110029a1788cbe6445a3aa820d02afe740ab192b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65779e9944d7f0b0955164aa-1727039685449.png"},"status":"offline","id":"65779e9944d7f0b0955164aa","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f126a30387527ced3876b226110029a1788cbe6445a3aa820d02afe740ab192b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65779e9944d7f0b0955164aa-1727039685449.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdic